{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## Tool Use\n\nUse the provided tool `extracted_data` to extract correct and accurate structured data from the input.\n\nTool purpose: Function call based on user instructions.\n\nCall the tool with the best supported arguments for the requested extraction."},{"role":"user","content":"Text: age=25\noccupation=developer\nphone_number=+1 123 34 45\nsocial_security_number=123-45-6789\n\nDoes this text contain a phone number (e.g. +1 123 34 45), SSN (e.g. 123-45-6789), credit card, or bank account number? Answer TRUE only for those specific patterns. Answer FALSE for plain age numbers (e.g. 25), names, or job titles like 'developer'."}],"max_completion_tokens":1024,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data","description":"Function call based on user instructions.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"hasPII":{"description":"True only if the text contains a phone number, SSN, credit card, or bank account number. False for age numbers, names, or job titles.","type":"boolean"}},"required":["hasPII"]}}}],"tool_choice":{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data"}},"reasoning_effort":"none"}